# Issue #563: restoring native resolution after an FSR1 upscale changes the
# scene band while the display size does not, and the transient pool was only
# evicted on a display resize; stale reduced-band transients rendered the
# scene black for about two frames. Both forward and deferred.
olo-state-machine-trace 1
seed 0
initial path=forward size=320x180 msaa=1 upscale=off features= blended=0 buffering=2 pose=0
op upscale performance
op upscale off
op path deferred
op upscale quality
op upscale off
